<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Set Successfully</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; 
            background: #0a0a0f; 
            padding: 40px 20px; 
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .card { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1117 0%, #1a1d2e 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px; 
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .header { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #0d9488 50%, #0891b2 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px; 
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);
        }
        .header-logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .header-logo span { color: #a7f3d0; }
        .success-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px auto;
            font-size: 36px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }
        .header h1 { 
            font-size: 28px; 
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff; 
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .content { padding: 36px 32px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .text { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .success-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12) 0%, rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.08) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .success-box .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #34d399; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .success-box .value { font-size: 15px; color: #a7f3d0; font-weight: 500; }
        .cta-section { text-align: center; margin: 32px 0; }
        .btn { 
            display: inline-block; 
            padding: 16px 40px; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #0d9488);
            color: #ffffff !important; 
            text-decoration: none !important; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.35);
        }
        .security-note {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .divider { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3), transparent); margin: 28px 0; }
        .footer { padding: 24px 32px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); text-align: center; }
        .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; }
        .footer a { color: #34d399; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-logo">hackbyte<span>codex</span></div>
            <div style="font-size: 48px; margin: 16px 0; position: relative; z-index: 1;">✅</div>
            <h1>Password Set Successfully!</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Great job, <%= fullName %>! 🎉</p>

            <p class="text">
                Your password for your HackByteCodex account has been successfully configured. 
                Your account is now fully secured and ready to go!
            </p>

            <div class="success-box">
                <div class="label">Account</div>
                <div class="value">📧 <%= email %></div>
            </div>

            <div class="security-note">
                🔒 <strong style="color: #cbd5e1;">Security Tip:</strong> Never share your password with anyone. 
                HackByteCodex will never ask for your password via email or phone. 
                If you didn't make this change, contact us immediately.
            </div>

            <div class="cta-section">
                <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;">You can now log in with your email and password:</p>
                <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn">🚀 Go to Dashboard</a>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p class="text" style="font-size: 13px;">
                Need help? Contact us at 
                <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #34d399;"><%= supportEmail %></a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> HackByteCodex. All rights reserved.<br>
            This email was sent to <%= email %> because your password was just updated.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
